			}]
			x: -5.1d
			y: 10.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["18B331087284BB4F"]
			description: [
				"你要去的是&c深海冰冻洋&r，让我提醒你——那里比你想象的还要&a冷得多&r。海水很危险，但我有&b抗冻卷轴&r，能帮你游泳而不至于冻成冰棍。不过，我还是建议你多穿点。在装备上穿上&b雪制衣物&r或&b保暖大衣&r，即使有了卷轴，也能抵御严寒。"
				""
				"这不仅仅是游泳。鬼魂&e科妮莉亚船长&r一直徘徊在这片水域，被困了很久。如果能找到她的踪迹——或者她船员遭遇了什么——或许就能让她安息。 &6寻找可能藏有线索的建筑&r。有一段故事等待着你去揭开，而完成它的重任就交给你了。"
			]
			id: "5E5E7C12C295D7ED"
			rewards: [{
				id: "5C0E81B5E35F7A49"
				item: {
					Count: 1
					id: "tombstone:scroll_of_frost_resistance"
					tag: {
						enchant: 1b
					}
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			tasks: [{
				biome: "minecraft:deep_frozen_ocean"
				icon: "minecraft:blue_ice"
				id: "3595B8728949191A"
				type: "biome"
			}]
			title: "找到一个深冻海洋"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 12.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5E5E7C12C295D7ED"]
			description: [
				"你快明白外面发生了什么，但仍需努力。三本&b日志&r散落在海洋各处，每本都记载着船员的故事。第一本在她的&c船&r上，第二本在&c前哨&r，最后一本藏在&c避难所&r里。找到它们，你就能知晓她的全部命运。"
				""
				"Once you’ve got all three, I’ll give you something - an old &bhorn&r. It’s powerful, but &abe careful with it&r. If you &6blow the &bhorn&r near the water, &eCornelia&r’s ghost will appear. She’s not the same as she once was, though. Whatever’s been keeping her trapped has also made her… hostile. &dSummoning her is not something you should do lightly&r."
			]
			id: "474F61F94EB65E2B"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "2A0764A68FAF9AE1"
					item: "aquamirae:shell_horn"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					auto: "invisible"
					id: "2CCB4FAEB4F23E1C"
					ignore_reward_blocking: true
					stage: "cornelia_begun"
					type: "gamestage"
				}
				{
					advancement: "dying_light:cornelia/cornelia_unlock"
					criterion: ""
					id: "76A71BACF6DBDEDA"
					type: "advancement"
				}
			]
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "6B19B6B292070339"
					item: {
						Count: 1
						id: "minecraft:written_book"
						tag: {
							author: "Unknown"
							generation: 3
							pages: [
								"{\"text\":\"Entry #34\\n\\nThese beasts from the depths prowl for someone to devour… One of those critters has already eaten our midshipman… Swallowed him whole along with his crossbow.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Entry #35\\n\\nWe are waiting in vain for rescue… No one will come to help us, we have to survive on our own. Today the construction of the fort from parts of the ship was completed. In any case, she could no longer plow the seas ever again.\"}"
								"{\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"Entry #36\\n\\nWe are no longer able to heat the fort, resources are running out. \"},{\"color\":\"dark_green\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"contents\":{\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"ↈ \"},{\"color\":\"green\",\"text\":\"Underground shelter\"},{\"text\":\"\\n   There are more structures\\n   underneath the ice... Looks\\n   like I have to go down to\\n   these terrible fish...\"}],\"text\":\"\"}},\"text\":\"[Part of the crew began to dig a shelter underground]\"},{\"text\":\". It is the only way we have a chance not to freeze to death.\"}],\"text\":\"\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Entry #37\\n\\nWe hid our supplies and valuable cargo underground. But Poseidon cursed us, and during the storm the lieutenant washed away into the sea… Along with master keys.\"}"
								"{\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"The hope remains that we could possibly find \"},{\"color\":\"dark_green\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"contents\":{\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"ↈ \"},{\"color\":\"green\",\"text\":\"Сargo keys\"},{\"text\":\"\\n   Without the keys, I will not\\n   be able to receive the\\n   most valuable cargo. I need\\n   to find other ships nearby.\"}],\"text\":\"\"}},\"text\":\"[similar keys on other ships of our fleet]\"},{\"text\":\", which have suffered the same fate as us.\"}],\"text\":\"\"}"
							]
							resolved: 1b
							title: "日志簿"
						}
					}
					match_nbt: true
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "0F7A486970318897"
					item: {
						Count: 1
						id: "minecraft:written_book"
						tag: {
							author: "Unknown"
							generation: 3
							pages: [
								"{\"text\":\"Entry #12\\n\\nLast afternoon, Captain Cornelia went to the seabed in search of any additional resources. There are rumors among the crew that the real subject of her expedition is something else.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"More than a day has passed since the captain's dive. She was wearing the only diving suit we had, so we couldn't help her in any way. Worst of all, she had the master key with her. As our hopes of rescue dwindle, the threat of rebellion grows.\"}"
							]
							resolved: 1b
							title: "日志簿"
						}
					}
					match_nbt: true
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "46B2060FEFB5579B"
					item: {
						Count: 1
						id: "minecraft:written_book"
						tag: {
							OBSData: { }
							author: "Unknown"
							generation: 3
							pages: [
								"{\"text\":\"Entry #41\\n\\nIn these cursed lands there you can’t find shelter even under the ice and the thickness of the earth... Some creatures that look like eels crawled out of the depths of the underworld, depriving us of the opportunity \"}"
								"{\"text\":\"to return back to the surface.\\n\\nOnly the mistress of the moon knows how long shall we last... At all events, our hopes of seeing sunlight had all but vanished. This place will become our grave, our eternal tomb. For us and that damned rune...\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Last Entry\\n\\nIt whispers to me, whispers inside my head the secrets of ice and snow... Ice... Now we are chained in ice forever...\\n\\nI suppose a similar fate awaits the crew that set out in search of the fire rune... I wonder if they made it\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"to the Great Dark Forest valley. Though it doesn't really matter now…\"}"
							]
							resolved: 1b
							title: "日志簿"
						}
					}
					match_nbt: true
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "探寻科妮莉亚的命运所在"
			x: -2.6999999999999997d
			y: 12.899999999999999d
		}
